                <invention-title lang="de">NÄHENSIGNALISIERUNG UND VERFAHREN FÜR LTE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">SIGNALISATION DE PROXIMITÉ ET PROCÉDURE POUR LTE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">PROXIMITY SIGNALING AND PROCEDURE FOR LTE</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A method for communication in a wireless telecommunications system comprises transmitting, by a first user equipment, UE, a first proximity beacon to a second UE according to at least one parameter of a pre-provisioned configuration; and detecting, by the first UE, a second proximity beacon transmitted by the second UE according to the at least one parameter. The at least one parameter indicates a pattern and a window defining a period including a transmission and detection opportunity, the pattern indicating a set of subframes in which a proximity beacon is to be transmitted or detected during the window.</p>
            </abstract>
